NAME NOT YET CLEARED
--------------------
"Firekeep" has passed a registry/domain/live-product pre-filter ONLY. USPTO
classes 9 and 42 and EUIPO searches are OUTSTANDING and still gate the rename.
A pre-filter is not clearance. Do not treat the name in this file, or anywhere
in this repository, as trademark-cleared until those searches are complete.
`Remanence` is held in reserve so a refusal does not restart the search.

MODEL
-----
Firekeep is free-core software, not open source. This licence is proprietary
and grants two tiers of use: a gratis Free Tier for a single user, and a paid
Team Tier that unlocks team features under a licence key. Neither tier confers
any right to see, copy, redistribute, or build derivative works from the
source code. Nothing in this licence should be read as an open-source or
source-available licence of any kind.

DEFINITIONS
-----------
"Software" means the Firekeep client kit, service components, and any
associated documentation, in object or source form as distributed to you.

"Team Features" means functionality that requires a licence key to unlock —
including, without limitation, multi-agent relay coordination, team-scoped
memory attribution, and the replay/evaluations dashboard — as opposed to the
single-user core.

"Commercial Agreement" means the separate written agreement between you and
Omnicron, LLC that governs your purchase of Team Features (including fees,
seat or deployment counts, term, and support), where applicable. This licence
does not itself state any price, seat count, or term; those are set in the
Commercial Agreement.

"You" or "Licensee" means the individual or entity exercising rights under
this licence.

1. FREE TIER GRANT
-------------------
Subject to your compliance with this licence, Omnicron, LLC grants you a
personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable, royalty-free (no fee) licence to
install and run the Software for your own use, as a single user, on one
deployment, for so long as this licence remains in effect. This grant may be
terminated only as provided in Section 3 (Licence Lifecycle) below.

This grant does NOT include, and you may not:
  - redistribute the Software, in whole or in part, to any third party;
  - sublicense the Software;
  - create or distribute derivative works based on the Software;
  - use the Software to provide a competing hosted or managed service to
    third parties;
  - remove or obscure any copyright, trademark, or proprietary notice.

The Software is closed source. No provision of this licence, and no act of
installing, running, or interacting with the Software, discloses source code
or grants any right to obtain it.

All rights not expressly granted in this Section 1 are reserved by
Omnicron, LLC.

2. TEAM TIER GRANT
-------------------
Team Features are unlocked by a licence key issued by Omnicron, LLC and are
licensed, not sold. Your right to use Team Features — including any fees,
number of seats or deployments, term, renewal, and support commitments — is
governed by the applicable Commercial Agreement between you and
Omnicron, LLC. This licence does not itself grant access to Team Features and
does not invent any pricing, seat count, or trial period; where the
Commercial Agreement is silent, the restrictions and disclaimers of this
licence apply to your use of Team Features as they do to the Free Tier.

If you have not entered into a Commercial Agreement, you are not licensed to
use Team Features, regardless of whether a licence key happens to unlock them
in a given build.

3. LICENCE LIFECYCLE
---------------------
This section is a term of your licence, not merely a description of how the
software happens to behave.

  - Expiry degrades; it does not brick. If a Team Tier licence key expires,
    is not renewed, or is otherwise no longer valid, Omnicron, LLC will
    degrade rather than disable the Software: write operations and routes
    gated behind Team Features or unreleased functionality may be blocked,
    but memory recall, data export, and other existing read paths continue
    to function indefinitely, without requiring a further licence purchase
    to regain read access to your own data.
  - Data export guarantee. At all times, including after expiry or
    termination of any licence granted under this document, you may export
    the data your deployment has accumulated (including memory, skills, and
    traces) in a documented format. This guarantee survives termination of
    this licence.
  - Termination for breach. Omnicron, LLC may terminate the licence granted
    in Section 1 or Section 2 if you materially breach this licence and do
    not cure that breach within a reasonable time after notice. Termination
    for breach ends your right to run the Software going forward; it does
    not override the data export guarantee above.

